"Perceptual_quantizer>`_"
msgstr ""
"`感知量化器的维基百科文章 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Perceptual_quantizer>`_"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_heif.rst:95
msgid ""
"`Hybrid Log Gamma on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Hybrid_log%E2%80%93gamma>`_"
msgstr ""
"`混合对数伽马的维基百科文章 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Hybrid_log%E2%80%93gamma>`_"
